# The crossed power follows sin^2(pi z / (2 L_c)).
# Reference: that law with the coupling length from the supermodes of the grid.
title Directional coupler cut at 0.25 of its coupling length
window width=14 length=5
guide straight x=-0.35 width=0.5 from=0 to=5
guide straight x=0.35 width=0.5 from=0 to=5
launch mode x=-0.35 width=0.5
monitor bar z=5 x=-0.35 width=0.5
monitor cross z=5 x=0.35 width=0.5
expect power bar 0.857645443 2e-7
expect power cross 0.144022471 2e-7
expect neff 2.631756959 2e-8
expect power cross 0.14645 0.02
expect sum bar cross 1.0 2e-3
